  "factor_name": "Dispersion-Conditioned Short-Term Reversal",
  "version": "20280713",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-pct_change(close,3) * clip(cross_sectional_mean(rolling_std(pct_change(close),5)) / rolling_median_60(cross_sectional_mean(rolling_std(pct_change(close),5))), 0.5, 2.0), shifted by 1 session",
    "description": "Ranks assets for reversal of their lagged three-session return, with the reversal signal scaled by the lagged market-wide cross-asset dispersion state. Elevated dispersion increases the magnitude, while the state multiplier is clipped for robustness. All inputs are lagged one completed session to prevent look-ahead."
